ADDITIONAL REVIEW NOTES
-----------------------

1) shutdown()
   → KEEP
   → App lifecycle responsibility.
   → Current signature cannot return an error, so logging the DB close
     error is appropriate.
   → Minor cleanup later: prefer log.Printf(...) over fmt.Println(...).

2) OpenMonthlyPayslip(), OpenYearlyPayslip(), OpenDir()
   → Likely share one underlying OS-opening helper during refactor.
   → Linux: xdg-open
   → Windows: explorer.exe
   → macOS: open

3) monthlyScopeRoot() / yearlyScopeRoot()
   → These are not generic path helpers.
   → They combine scope resolution, DB lookup, and output-path construction.
   → Keep them with their respective generation workflows.

4) yearlyScopeRoot()
   → REVIEW LATER:
     yearlyScopeRoot() currently continues on some GetYearlyPayslip()
     errors instead of returning the error, unlike the monthly counterpart.
   → Do not change during sanitization; inspect during actual refactor.

5) ImportPayroll()
   → REVIEW LATER:
     source/destination file Close() errors are currently not handled.
   → Not part of tonight's structural refactor.


